    "difficultyReason": "The three parts are signposted: factorise 18, apply (ab)^n = a^n × b^n to 2 × 3², then simplify (3²)³. The student links the product-power and power-of-power rules, with a non-prime base kept as 3² in part b. That is more than the direct power-of-power fill-ins. It is less than p54-q4, which needs the student to see and write the factorisation themselves.",
